# HTML games — V1.0 now, V2.0 later

Words: [README.md — Words used](../../README.md#words-used-in-this-project).
This is **copy 1** of Version 1.0 walls / Version 2.0 `MK.HTML` (copy 2:
[docs/JMR_JS_COMPATIBILITY.md](../../docs/JMR_JS_COMPATIBILITY.md)
§ Version 1.0 vs 2.0). Authoring how-to:
[docs/GAME_DESIGN.md](../../docs/GAME_DESIGN.md).

**V1.0** = what PYTHON + FPGA-SIM play today for product + library titles.
**V2.0** = machine work so **`storage/MK.HTML` as embedded today** can
`LOAD`/`RUN`. Do **not** title-gate (`if (stem == "MK")`).

## V1.0 — write titles inside these walls

| Cap / hole | Author around it |
|---|---|
| **`MAX_SPR` = 16** ASET descriptors | ≤16 `data:image` sheets. Pack frames into **atlases**; crop with **9-arg `drawImage`**. Do not ship one URI per frame (MKPVP: 274 → refuse). |
| **`Object.keys` / `for…in`** | Compiler lowers `for (k in obj)` → `Object.keys`. RTL lacks that native (`fault=5` / `fsite=4183`). Use literal key lists or indexed loops. |
| **`setTransform(-1, …)` mirror** | PYTHON `_xf` does `max(1, w*sx)` — negative scale → 1px. Prefer **left + right** sheets. |
| **Math** | Only `floor` / `abs` / `min` / `max` / `random` / `sqrt` (+ `Math.PI`). No `round` native in V1. |
| **Heap caps (live silicon)** | `MAX_OBJ=960`, arrays `1536×32 + 12×128`, `ENV_DEPTH=384`, `ARR_CAP=128`. Loud overflow. Do not assume old 1024/512. [FPGA_FIT.md](../../docs/FPGA_FIT.md). |
| **Glass / Esc** | 640×480 Canvas fill; Esc = machine BREAK. |

**V1 library example:** `storage/MKPVP.HTML` (3 atlases, L/R sheets, no `for-in`).

**V1 product acceptance:** `INVADERS` / `PACMAN` / `DONKEY`.

## V2.0 — required for current `MK.HTML` (not vague “more”)

Measured from `storage/MK.HTML` (re-measure if art changes):

| Requirement | Number / behavior |
|---|---|
| Sprite descriptors | **`MAX_SPR` = `PROGRAM_MAX_SPRITES` ≥ 518** (unique sheets today; V1 = 16) |
| Asset bank | **V2.0 = 8 MB** (or more) simple SRAM port — MK needs ~4.63 MB. ASIC: **single chip**, no fancy multi-bank access. V1 stays 4 MB. |
| Compiler | Accept **`new mk.arenas.Arena(…)`** / **70** dotted `new mk.…` sites (today: `EXPECTED '('` line 738) |
| Native | **`Object.keys`** (or real `for…in`) — **5** `for…in` loops in MK |
| Native | **`Math.round`** — **2** call sites (shim is temporary) |

```text
// BAD V1 — one data:image per frame past MAX_SPR=16
// GOOD V1 — atlas + 9-arg drawImage (MKPVP)
// V2 — MK.HTML keeps 518 sheets; raise descriptor table to ≥518
